@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra trang thai may chu API -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach tat ca bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Lay chi tiet bai tap hop le -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Lay bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai tap 1 hop le -> 201 Created + Header Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao qua Location ID -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai tap 1 voi body rong -> 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 9. Doc luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 10. Nop thieu Content-Type header -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### 11. Sai phuong thuc HTTP tren URI hop le -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
